<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Fear not, little flock, He goeth ahead,</l><l>Your Shepherd selecteth the path you must tread;</l><l>The waters of Marah He’ll sweeten for thee,</l><l>He drank all the bitter in Gethsemane.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Fear not, little flock, whatever your lot,</l><l>He enters all rooms, “the doors being shut”</l><l>He never forsakes, He never is gone,</l><l>So count on His presence in darkness and dawn.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
